Wine ALSA MIDI name shim
------------------------

`alsa-midi-name-shim.c` is original project code. CI builds it as a
shared library and the launcher preloads it only for Wine. It changes
the ALSA capability names needed by the original AG06/AG03 controller; it
does not modify Yamaha's executable or MIDI messages.

The shim presents Wine's `AG06/AG03 - AG06/AG03 MIDI 1` as `AG06/AG03`, which
is the name expected by the unmodified Yamaha application. It is covered by
this project's WTFPL license.

This project is independent and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Yamaha.
